UPDATE tools SET faq = $x$[{"q": "Is Freepik now called Magnific?", "a": "Yes. On April 28, 2026 Freepik rebranded as Magnific, uniting its stock library, AI generation tools and the Magnific upscaler under one name. freepik.com now redirects to magnific.com."}, {"q": "Is Magnific (Freepik) free?", "a": "The current pricing page does not list a free plan; individual paid plans are Premium, Premium+ and Pro Starter, with separate Teams plans for larger organizations. Web prices are shown in local currency and vary by region; US App Store in-app pricing lists Premium at $26.00 a month (or $234.99 a year) and Premium+ at $55.00 a month (or $494.99 a year)."}, {"q": "Which AI models does Magnific include?", "a": "Magnific offers many leading third-party models, including Kling, Seedance, Google Veo, Gemini Omni, MiniMax, Nano Banana, FLUX, Recraft, Ideogram and Grok, plus its own Magnific One image model (included in all paid plans) and music and sound tools from Google Lyria and ElevenLabs."}, {"q": "What does unlimited mean on Magnific?", "a": "Most paid plans include unlimited generation on select image models for part or all of the year, though which specific models are unlimited can vary by plan. Video, audio and editing tools still consume credits, and speed can be limited during busy periods."}]$x$::jsonb
